                    <span class="text-danger me-2">●</span> Open to software engineering and ML internships
                </span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-dark rounded-1 px-4 py-2 fw-semibold" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">See projects</a>
                <a href="mailto:siddharthkalra2005@gmail.com" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-1 px-4 py-2 fw-semibold" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">Get in touch</a>
