                        <br><br>
                        Alongside web development, I actively work with computer vision and deep learning frameworks, including building a real-time OCR calculator from scratch using Convolutional Neural Networks.
                    </p>
                    
                    <ul class="list-unstyled custom-bullet mt-4">
                        <li>JEE Main AIR 20,175 (98.26%ile)</li>
                        <li>Solved 500+ DSA problems</li>
                        <li>Competitive Chess (~1500 Rapid)</li>
                        <li>Zonal Badminton Medalist</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <div class="contact-box p-4 rounded-3 d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-center gap-3">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">Looking for a developer or collaborator?</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-0 mono-text" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">Let's talk.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <a href="mailto:siddharthkalra2005@gmail.com" class="btn btn-dark rounded-1 px-4 py-2 fw-medium" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">Email me</a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/siddharth-kalra-188b842b3/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-1 px-4 py-2 fw-medium" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">LinkedIn</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
